{"id":"n1-191","title":"～とあれば (〜to areba)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses a condition; 'if', 'when', 'since'.","longExplanation":"The ～とあれば grammar point is used to express a condition or premise in which a certain outcome or action naturally follows. It can be translated as 'if,' 'when,' or 'since,' depending on context. It emphasizes that under this specific condition, a certain response is expected.","formation":"Verb-casual + とあれば / い-Adjective + とあれば / な-Adjective + だとあれば / Noun + だとあれば","examples":[{"jp":"無料とあれば、誰でも利用したいと思います。","romaji":"Muryou to areba, dare demo riyou shitai to omoimasu.","en":"If it's free, anyone would want to use it.","words":[{"surface":"無料","vocabId":"1531040","reading":"むりょう"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あれ","vocabId":"1857320","reading":"あれ","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ば","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"誰","vocabId":"1416830","reading":"だれ"},{"surface":"でも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"利用","vocabId":"1549660","reading":"りよう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"たい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"思い","vocabId":"1589320","reading":"おもい","baseForm":"思う"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3]},{"jp":"この曲が流れるとあれば、彼は必ず踊り始めます。","romaji":"Kono kyoku ga nagareru to areba, kare wa kanarazu odorihajimemasu.","en":"If this song starts playing, he will definitely begin to dance.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"曲","vocabId":"1239700","reading":"きょく"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"流れる","vocabId":"1552140","reading":"ながれる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あれ","vocabId":"1857320","reading":"あれ","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ば","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"必ず","vocabId":"1487400","reading":"かならず"},{"surface":"踊り","vocabId":"1546880","reading":"おどり","baseForm":"踊る"},{"surface":"始め","vocabId":"1342540","reading":"はじめ","baseForm":"始める"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]},{"jp":"明日が休日だとあれば、今夜は遅くまで起きていられます。","romaji":"Ashita ga kyuujitsu da to areba, konya wa osoku made okite iraremasu.","en":"If tomorrow is a holiday, I can stay up late tonight.","words":[{"surface":"明日","vocabId":"1584660","reading":"あした"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"休日","vocabId":"1228040","reading":"きゅうじつ"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あれ","vocabId":"1857320","reading":"あれ","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ば","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"今夜","vocabId":"1289520","reading":"こんや"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遅く","vocabId":"1421970","reading":"おそい","baseForm":"遅い"},{"surface":"まで","vocabId":null},{"surface":"起き","vocabId":"1223640","reading":"おきる","baseForm":"起きる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"られ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"られる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]},{"jp":"彼が参加するとあれば、このイベントは成功でしょう。","romaji":"Kare ga sanka suru to areba, kono ibento wa seikou deshou.","en":"If he participates, this event will surely be successful.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"参加","vocabId":"1302090","reading":"さんか"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あれ","vocabId":"1857320","reading":"あれ","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ば","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"イベント","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"成功","vocabId":"1375690","reading":"せいこう"},{"surface":"でしょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]}]}